meta {
  name: Get Timetable
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/lines/DJ/timetable?date=2026-08-19&station=DCL
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  date: 2026-08-19
  station: DCL
}

docs {
  Every departure of one line on one date.

  - `date` optional, defaults to today, must be `YYYY-MM-DD` (422 otherwise)
  - `station` optional station code (422 if not part of this line or unknown);
    both directions are returned when omitted
  - Sorted by departure time ascending, then station code ascending
  - A suspended line returns an empty array (not a 404)
  - All departures are returned, even cancelled ones, with their status
}
